          Realigning the organisation<br>behind the strategy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          After eight weeks of diagnosis, one cause keeps coming back. Align before relaunching: the organisation is not built to execute.
        </p>
        <!-- Author -->
